description:
Been deep in the UK sound lately and the creativity, fresh drums, and sound design have been genuinely inspiring.

This mix builds in a similar fashion to Fred's own musical journey — starting with the chill, hopeful, poetry-vocal house that defines his early work, moving into bouncier UK garage and faster house, then evolving into heavier bass and the UK rap-inspired sounds he's been exploring lately. Putting this together made me reflect on my own journey as a DJ and how fun it's been exploring new sounds. I think Fred would be into it. Enjoy.

